{"applicability_conditions":"纳米压痕测量：将三棱锥金刚石压头（Berkovich 型）压入样品表面，施加递增载荷至预设值并记录载荷与位移，用于测定亚微米尺度的力学性能（弹性模量、硬度）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0039","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nE _ {\\mathrm{r}} = \\frac {\\sqrt {\\pi}}{2 \\sqrt {A (h _ {\\mathrm{c}})}} S, \\qquad \\frac {P}{A (h _ {\\mathrm{c}})}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmatprotec.2004.04.114"},"latex":"E_{\\mathrm{r}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2\\sqrt{A(h_{\\mathrm{c}})}} S, \\qquad \\frac{P}{A(h_{\\mathrm{c}})}","purpose":"由纳米压痕的载荷-位移曲线计算约化弹性模量 E_r（式中同时给出硬度表达式 P/A(h_c)）。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"约化弹性模量（reduced elastic modulus），纳米压痕测得的弹性模量","symbol":"E_{\\mathrm{r}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率常数","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"样品与压头尖端之间的接触面积（contact area between the sample and the indenter tip）","symbol":"A(h_{\\mathrm{c}})","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"接触深度（contact depth）","symbol":"h_{\\mathrm{c}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"接触刚度（contact stiffness）","symbol":"S","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"压痕载荷（indentation load）","symbol":"P","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["公式(2)同时给出两个量：约化弹性模量 E_r 与硬度 P/A(h_c)。","论文提到由载荷-位移曲线可计算机械性能（弹性模量与硬度），但仅 'where' 从句明确解释了 S、P、A(h_c) 三个符号。"]}